  "profileCompletionStep3HelpBody": "Aap ki sehat ki tafseelat personalized hifazati alerts aur tajaweez banane mein madad deti hain. Aap yeh kabhi bhi apne profile se update kar sakte hain.",
  "privacyPolicyAppBarTitle": "Data aur Privacy",
  "privacyPolicyHeading": "CurecordAI aap ka data kaise sambhalta hai",
  "privacyPolicyIntro": "Yeh page batata hai ke hum kaunsa sehat ka data jama karte hain, ise kaise istemal kiya jata hai, aur is par aap ke paas kya ikhtiyarat hain.",
  "privacyPolicyDataWeCollectTitle": "Hum Jo Data Jama Karte Hain",
  "privacyPolicyDataWeCollectBody": "Aap ka zaati sehat record faraham karne ke liye, hum aap ki faraham kardah profile tafseelat (naam, tareekh paidaish, gender, contact maloomat), aap ke upload kiye gaye tibbi documents, un documents se nikala gaya structured clinical data (bimariyan, dawaiyan, lab results, allergies, aur visit history), aur in-app AI assistant ke sath aap ki guftagu mehfooz karte hain. Hum aap ke account ko mehfooz rakhne ke liye bunyadi device aur session metadata (IP address, device ki qisam, login timestamps) bhi record karte hain.",
  "privacyPolicyHowWeUseDataTitle": "Hum Aap Ka Data Kaise Istemal Karte Hain",
  "privacyPolicyHowWeUseDataBody": "Aap ka data sirf un features ko chalane ke liye istemal hota hai jo aap istemal karte hain: upload kiye gaye documents se structured sehat ki maloomat nikalna, AI khulase banana, AI Chat mein aap ke records ke mutaliq sawalat ka jawab dena, aap ka profile completion score nikalna, aap ka Emergency Medical Card bharna, aur family members, caregivers ya clinicians ke sath mehfooz ishtirak mumkin banana jise aap wazeh tor par ijazat dete hain.",
  "privacyPolicyAiProcessingTitle": "AI Processing",
  "privacyPolicyAiProcessingBody": "Jab koi document process hota hai ya aap AI Chat mein sawal karte hain, to mutaliqa document ka content ya record data sirf clinical data nikalne ya jawab banane ke liye hamare AI processing provider ko bheja jata hai. Yeh data sirf aap ki request poori karne ke liye istemal hota hai - yeh kisi third-party AI models ko train karne ke liye istemal nahi hota, aur AI provider ise us ek request ko process karne ke liye darkar waqt se zyada mehfooz nahi rakhta.",
  "privacyPolicyStorageSecurityTitle": "Storage aur Security",
  "privacyPolicyStorageSecurityBody": "Upload kiye gaye documents encrypted cloud storage mein mehfooz kiye jate hain, aur transit mein maujood tamam data TLS encryption se mehfooz hai. Aap ke records tak rasai sirf aap ke account aur un family members ya caregivers tak mehdood hai jinhein aap wazeh tor par rasai dete hain. Aap kabhi bhi log out kar ke is device ka login session cancel kar sakte hain, jo foran mutaliqa access aur refresh tokens ko ghair faal kar deta hai.",
  "privacyPolicyFamilyAccessTitle": "Family aur Caregiver Access",
  "privacyPolicyFamilyAccessBody": "Agar aap apne account mein family members ya caregivers shamil karte hain, to woh sirf un records aur data ko dekh sakte hain jo aap ne un ke liye banai gayi family member profile tak mehdood kiye hon. Har family member profile mein kya maujood hai yeh aap ke control mein rehta hai aur aap kabhi bhi Family Management se access khatam kar sakte hain.",
  "privacyPolicySharingCliniciansTitle": "Clinicians ke Sath Ishtirak",
  "privacyPolicySharingCliniciansBody": "Apne dashboard se QR code banana muntakhib records ke liye ek waqt ki hadd wala, cancel kiya ja sakne wala share link banata hai. Ise scan karne wale clinicians sirf us share mein shamil records dekh sakte hain - kabhi bhi aap ka mukammal account nahi - aur aap kabhi bhi access cancel kar sakte hain.",
  "privacyPolicyYourRightsTitle": "Aap Ke Huqooq",
  "privacyPolicyYourRightsBody": "Aap kabhi bhi Settings → Export My Data se apne sehat ke data ka mukammal export request kar sakte hain, Consent Management se mukhtalif razamandiyan dekh aur wapas le sakte hain, aur woh records mustaqil tor par delete kar sakte hain jo aap ab mehfooz nahi rakhna chahte. Delete kardah records foran active istemal se hata diye jate hain aur hamare standard retention schedule par backups se saaf kar diye jate hain.",
  "privacyPolicyDataRetentionTitle": "Data Retention",
  "privacyPolicyDataRetentionBody": "Hum aap ka data us waqt tak mehfooz rakhte hain jab tak aap ka account faal rehta hai. Agar aap koi record delete karte hain, to yeh foran app se chhupa diya jata hai aur upar bayan kardah retention ki muddat ke andar hamare systems se mustaqil tor par saaf kar diya jata hai. Agar aap apna account delete karte hain, to tamam mutaliqa zaati aur tibbi data mustaqil delete ke liye schedule kar diya jata hai.",
  "privacyPolicyContactTitle": "Rabta",
  "privacyPolicyContactBody": "Agar aap ke paas is baare mein sawalat hain ke aap ka data kaise sambhala jata hai, to neeche diye gaye Support link se hamari support team se rabta karein aur hamein madad kar ke khushi hogi.",
